From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Knowable Labs <knowl@knowl.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:37:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] webapp: no formatting options in the composer, and a
 place for Knowl's Stop

A message to an agent is plain words, an attachment and an emoji. The formatting
bar, its toggle and the preview are not rendered, and with the bar go the controls
it carried: priority, burn on read, plugin and AI actions. The Help link under the
composer, which opened the formatting help, goes too. Markdown typed by hand
still renders. Beside Send is an empty element where Knowl's plugin draws Stop
while agents are working.

docs/guides/agent-workspace-design.md, The composer.
